Stage 3 maintenance notes
=========================

There are currently no known unimplemented Stage 3 correctness checks tracked in
this file.

The historical CONSTANT-assignment item is implemented by
`lvalue_check_c::check_assignment_to_constant()` in `stage3/lvalue_check.cc`.
New semantic gaps should be recorded in the language feature catalogue or an
OpenSpec change with regression evidence instead of being added as an unscoped
TODO.
